A pinned card's primary swipe action is still Settle (or Archive on legacy servers), not Unpin — so the main mobile swipe gesture on a pinned row settles or archives the thread instead of unpinning it. The `pinnedRow` flag only controls the pin glyph and the long-press menu item; it is never passed into `resolveThreadListV2SwipeActions` or the `primaryAction` memo, so the swipe path never produces an Unpin action. Route the pinned state into `primaryAction` selection and return `handleUnpin` for pinned rows.

